          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Diendaida Moabu, BWANA ukadizera, ‘Wukenyi mmbwade charo chenyu, mruwuke vololo ya Arnoni; olenyi namneka Sihoni Muamori, uo mzuri wa Heshboni chiaimweri na isanga jake; jiwadenyi mzoe kulwa nawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idime niko nizoyagha kungira kiture na wowa kwa wandu wose wimuobuo inyo; kula andu wichaasikira malagho ghenyu, wichasughusika na kukaia na wasi kwa wundu ghonyu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli kumsima mzuri Sihoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niko neredumieghe wadumwa kufuma kireti cha Kedemothi kwa mzuri wa Heshboni na malagho gha sere ngighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nisighe niide aghadi ya isanga jako; nichaghenda na chia cheni hata sichaaghaluka nisighe chia anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vindo veja na machi ghenywa dighua kwako, ela kudisighe tu diidie isangenyi kwako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata dameria kuruwuka moda ghwa Jordani, na kungia ijo isanga BWANA Mlungu udinekagha. Huwo niko wandu wa kivalwa cha Esau awo wikaiagha Seiri, na Wamoabu, awo wikaiagha Ari, weredibonyereghe.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela Sihoni mzuri wa Heshboni, ukadileghia diseide kaavui na isanga jake, angu BWANA Mlungu onyu oreikurishireghe ngolo yake, ukang'eta; eri upate kudibonya dimsime seji iko idime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukanizera, ‘Olenyi namfunyira Sihoni na isanga jake mumsime, idana zoenyi kujiwusa mpate kujikaia.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Sihoni na wandu wake wose wikacha kulwa nesi aja Jahazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA Mlungu odu ukamfunya Sihoni na wana wake, na wandu wake wose dikawisima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesi dikaiwada mizi yake yose mibaa ngelo ija na kunona-nona kula muzi; womi, waka, na wanake; hata ndederesighieghe kindo chingi anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mfugho riekeri, na vilambo ivo dereviwadieghe mizinyi, nivo dereviwusireghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekuwadie muzi ghoredilemieghe. Kufuma Aroeri, muzi ghuko mdonyi ghwa vololo ya Arnoni, na kufuma muzi m'baa ghuko vololonyi, hata Gileadi, BWANA Mlungu odu oredinekieghe yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andu koni diserekusoghodereghe kaavui ni isanga ja Waamoni jiko mbai-mbai ya moda ghwa Jaboki kose, na mizi ya isanga ja mghondinyi, na andu kuzima kose BWANA Mlungu odu oredikanieghe diseghende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
